[2026-03-03 10:27:31 - INFO - Task: N/A - Event: N/A - Role: FinalSummary - Builds: [N/A]]: Alleria Windrunner is a pivotal character in the World of Warcraft lore, known for her complex journey and significant role in key events. She is the daughter of Varian Wrynn and a former paladin of the Silver Hand. After her father's death, she joined the Silver Hand under Tirion Fordring's guidance. However, she later became disillusioned with the Holy Light and aligned with the Scourge, believing it was the only way to protect her people. This decision branded her a traitor to the Alliance. Eventually, she turned against the Lich King, contributing crucially to the defeat of the Scourge in Northrend. Alleria is also a playable character in the game, with a class change from paladin to death knight in later expansions. The information provided is derived from the library's archives with 90% confidence. Note that external internet research beyond the library's resources is not conducted within this system.
